  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jgraph/jgraphx/v3.3.0.1/license.txt
* com.microsoft:z3:1.0 (com.microsoft.z3.jar): manifest version 4.3.0. Its exact
  upstream license is Microsoft Research License Agreement, Non-Commercial Use
  Only. Copying/distribution is limited to the stated non-commercial purposes,
